const e={"react.any.1":"No. Not even at three in the morning.","react.any.2":"Interesting idea. Wrong, but interesting.","react.any.3":"How does an idea like that even happen?","react.any.4":"Jamming everything into everything is not a method.","react.any.5":"Rub this on every object in town and eventually something works. Not this time.","react.any.6":"Nothing happened. Nothing was supposed to.","react.any.7":"If this were a rubber chicken, maybe. It isn't.","react.any.8":"Noting it: tested, doesn't work. Don't test again.","react.any.9":"Nobody teaches that anywhere. For good reason.","react.any.10":"Nice try. No.","react.any.11":"Looks like somebody's just going down the inventory.","react.any.12":"If that works, physics needs a rewrite.","react.any.13":"That one stays out of the report.","react.any.14":"Doesn't fit. Not the shape, not the logic.","react.any.15":"Let's pretend that never happened.","react.any.16":"Somewhere inside the mountain, something just sighed. In disappointment.","react.any.17":"I could try harder. But no.","react.any.18":"No click, no flash, no secret passage. Shame.","react.any.19":"That wasn't me. My hands did that on their own.","react.any.20":"In stories like this, everything usually works with everything. Not in this one.","react.combine.1":"Combine these two? Even my imagination has limits.","react.combine.2":"How would anyone even think of that?","react.combine.3":"Nothing to stick them together with. And no reason to.","react.combine.4":"Rub them together long enough and maybe a genie shows up. Probably not.","react.combine.5":"They're just not right for each other. It happens.","react.combine.6":"Add some rope, duct tape and a rubber duck... No, still no.","react.combine.7":"They get along fine in one pocket. Combined, no.","react.combine.8":"Combining everything with everything. Bad habit. I know it well.","react.combine.9":"Result: the same two things. Separately.","react.combine.10":"No. Bold attempt, though.","react.combine.11":"Even for Echo Ridge, that's too weird.","react.combine.12":"I turn them this way and that. They don't mind. Nothing happens.","react.combine.13":"Science says no. So does the supernatural.","react.combine.14":"No manual in the world suggests that.","react.combine.15":"I'll put them side by side. Let them work it out.","react.combine.16":"I'm no inventor. Especially not at night.","react.item.amespage.1":"The mountain answers when you call it by name. This doesn't answer anybody.","react.item.amespage.2":"Pastor Ames wrote about the mountain. Not about this.","react.item.amespage.3":"That page waited over a hundred years. Not for this.","react.item.amespage.4":"I could read it aloud. I don't think a sermon helps here.","react.item.archivekey.1":'The tag says "Archive." Not "anything."',"react.item.archivekey.2":"It came out of Vail's pocket. Taking it was bad enough.","react.item.archivekey.3":"No. The archive is somewhere else.","react.item.archivekey.4":"The key fits one door. This isn't a door. Or not that one.","react.item.badge.1":"FBI, open up! No? Fine.","react.item.badge.2":"The badge works on people. Not even all of them.","react.item.badge.3":"Flashing a badge at inanimate objects. A new low.","react.item.badge.4":"No reaction. Even my badge photo shows more respect.","react.item.batteries.1":"Batteries. Put them where, exactly? Right.","react.item.batteries.2":"Gus said they'd last all winter. Not for this.","react.item.batteries.3":"Not everything runs on batteries. Too bad.","react.item.batteries.4":"Plus to plus, minus to minus... No, still nonsense.","react.item.bill20.1":"A bribe? Not even twenty bucks gets a reaction.","react.item.bill20.2":"That's all my cash till Monday. No way.","react.item.bill20.3":"Money solves a lot. Not this.","react.item.bill20.4":"Twenty won't buy anything here. Not even change.","react.item.boatkey.1":"A boat key. See a boat? Me neither.","react.item.boatkey.2":"The cork keeps the key afloat. The idea's already sunk.","react.item.boatkey.3":"The padlock it opens is on a boat. Not here.","react.item.boatkey.4":"Nice key. Wrong everything.","react.item.carkeys.1":"These are keys to a Chevy. That is not a Chevy.","react.item.carkeys.2":"The '64 deputy's star on the ring doesn't help either.","react.item.carkeys.3":"Can't start that. Not even with keys.","react.item.carkeys.4":"Hanley would shake his head right now. Slowly.","react.item.cat.1":"Mr. Fox is looking at me like I'm an idiot. He's right.","react.item.cat.2":"A cat is not a tool. A cat is a cat.","react.item.cat.3":"Mr. Fox declines to take part. I respect that.","react.item.cat.4":"Poke things with a cat, there'll be scratches. Not on the cat.","react.item.chart.1":"Seven, three, three. Just not here.","react.item.chart.2":"The recorder could chart how fast this idea is falling apart.","react.item.chart.3":"The strip is long. Not long enough for this.","react.item.chart.4":"Measure something with it? Only my stubbornness.","react.item.coffee.1":"Coffee won't help with that. Coffee barely helps anyone.","react.item.coffee.2":"Pour out the coffee? Never. I need it more.","react.item.coffee.3":"This coffee could probably dissolve a lock. Let's not find out.","react.item.coffee.4":"Offering coffee to everything is not much of a strategy.","react.item.copy.1":"The copy does nothing here. Except duplicate my disappointment.","react.item.copy.2":"Lenny didn't make that dub so I could wave it at everything.","react.item.copy.3":"No. It's a good recording, but not that good.","react.item.copy.4":"Without a tape deck, a tape is just plastic. Very mysterious plastic.","react.item.cranekey.1":"The crane key. No crane here. Just me and my idea.","react.item.cranekey.2":"The crane's control box is at the sawmill. Not here.","react.item.cranekey.3":"Turn the key in thin air, nothing lifts.","react.item.cranekey.4":"This key's thirty years old. It's never seen anything like this.","react.item.dime.1":"A dime, and not a single screw in sight. Bad deal.","react.item.dime.2":"A dime turns screws. It doesn't work miracles.","react.item.dime.3":"Flip it to decide? No, that won't help either.","react.item.dime.4":"Ten cents. About what this idea is worth.","react.item.ellennote.1":"It's a note, not a lockpick.","react.item.ellennote.2":"The paper won't like it. Neither will I.","react.item.ellennote.3":"Teletype paper has been through a lot. Not this, though.","react.item.ellennote.4":"Read it again? The answer still isn't in there.","react.item.ellenpass.1":"Clearance level two. Not high enough for this.","react.item.ellenpass.2":"The woman in that photo would never try this.","react.item.ellenpass.3":"The pass opens base doors. Nothing else.","react.item.ellenpass.4":"If security sees me waving my pass around like this, I'll be mopping floors.","react.item.flashlight.1":"I can shine a light on it. Understanding it takes a different tool.","react.item.flashlight.2":"Plenty of light. Zero point.","react.item.flashlight.3":"Shine on it all night, it won't confess. This isn't an interrogation.","react.item.flashlight.4":"A flashlight is for the dark. Not for whatever this is.","react.item.freqlog.1":"A frequency log isn't a treasure map. Just as confusing, though.","react.item.freqlog.2":"Miller logged everything. Not one line about this.","react.item.freqlog.3":"I could read it out loud. It still won't answer.","react.item.freqlog.4":"Frequencies don't open doors. Usually.","react.item.gatekey.1":"It's a gate key. See a gate around here? Neither do I.","react.item.gatekey.2":`The sheriff said give it to no one. "Don't jam it into stuff" was implied.`,"react.item.gatekey.3":"Doesn't fit. Keys rarely fit everything.","react.item.gatekey.4":"This key opens exactly one thing. This isn't it.","react.item.glasses.1":"Through Buck's glasses it looks the same. Just dustier.","react.item.glasses.2":"Buck can't see without them. I can't see the point with them.","react.item.glasses.3":"The tape holds the arm on. It can't hold this idea together.","react.item.glasses.4":"Put glasses on it? Bold. Wrong, but bold.","react.item.joecard.1":"Clock in? Joe already did. Thirty years ago.","react.item.joecard.2":"It's a time card. It goes in a time clock, not in everything.","react.item.joecard.3":"Joe never clocked out. This isn't going anywhere either.","react.item.joecard.4":"Nobody's paying overtime for this.","react.item.maracard.1":'"Excluded." So is this idea.',"react.item.maracard.2":"Twelve-year-old Mara in the photo looks like she knows this is dumb.","react.item.maracard.3":"You don't stick a file card on things. You hide it.","react.item.maracard.4":'"Subject M." The subject has nothing to do with it.',"react.item.matches.1":"Setting things on fire isn't an FBI method. It's an arsonist's.","react.item.matches.2":"Matches? Really? How does an idea like that even happen?","react.item.matches.3":"In this damp the match won't even light. Thank God.","react.item.matches.4":"Twenty matches in the book. Not one good idea.","react.item.mitten.1":"The mitten waited twenty years. Not for this.","react.item.mitten.2":"A tiny mitten. A hand barely fits, let alone a plan.","react.item.mitten.3":"It matters to me. I'm not shoving it at things.","react.item.mitten.4":"A snowflake on the mitten. No snow here. No use either.","react.item.mittens.1":"Mittens keep hands warm. That's their whole skill set.","react.item.mittens.2":"Hard to do in mittens. Pointless without them.","react.item.mittens.3":"They're mittens. Not pot holders, not tools, not a rag.","react.item.mittens.4":"Even the snowflake on the mitten thinks this is a weird idea.","react.item.notebook.1":"Miller drew a lot of diagrams. None of them for this.","react.item.notebook.2":`"They answer." This doesn't.`,"react.item.notebook.3":"I could whack it with the notebook. I could. But why?","react.item.notebook.4":'Plenty of frequencies in there. No page called "use on this."',"react.item.pass.1":"Red clearance. Just not for this.","react.item.pass.2":"A twenty-year-old pass with someone else's face. Even a guard would laugh.","react.item.pass.3":"Flashing a pass at everything isn't a strategy.","react.item.pass.4":"Young Miller in the photo looks disappointed in me.","react.item.polaroid.1":"The photo won't help here. It just stings for nothing.","react.item.polaroid.2":"Hold up a polaroid and wait for something to develop? No.","react.item.polaroid.3":"This picture waited twenty years. It can wait a bit more.","react.item.polaroid.4":"Mom in the photo looks puzzled. Fair.","react.item.postcard.1":"No stamp. It isn't going anywhere, least of all there.","react.item.postcard.2":"Nobody here needs greetings from a night diner.","react.item.postcard.3":"It's a postcard, not a passcard.","react.item.postcard.4":"Sign it and leave it here? No mailman's coming this far.","react.item.protocol.1":"The file's almost empty. Like this plan.","react.item.protocol.2":"The Silence Protocol says to keep quiet. I'll take the hint.","react.item.protocol.3":"Just the index, the rest is gone. Maybe that was the page for this.","react.item.protocol.4":"A secret file is not a tray. Or an umbrella.","react.item.quarters.1":"Quarters are for machines. That's not a machine. I think.","react.item.quarters.2":"I could toss a coin for luck. It won't add any.","react.item.quarters.3":"Twenty dollars in change, and none of it helps.","react.item.quarters.4":"It jingles. That's all it does.","react.item.record.1":"A record needs a turntable. I don't see one.","react.item.record.2":"Spinning a record on your finger doesn't count.","react.item.record.3":"I'm not scratching it. It might be the last copy.","react.item.record.4":"Vail labeled it personally. Definitely not for this.","react.item.reel74.1":"The reel needs a tape player, not new friends.","react.item.reel74.2":"The tape's thin. The idea is thinner.","react.item.reel74.3":"Unspool it here? I'd be rewinding it half the night.","react.item.reel74.4":'The label says "For T. Miller." Wrong addressee.',"react.item.sparekey.1":"That's the key to Miller's house. This isn't Miller's house.","react.item.sparekey.2":'"Fox, twice a day." The tag says nothing about this.',"react.item.sparekey.3":"Sticking a key into every crack is a bad habit.","react.item.sparekey.4":"No. The key's a spare. The idea's a dud.","react.item.star.1":"It's a heavy star. Nobody here to pull rank on.","react.item.star.2":"In the name of the law... Nope, still nothing.","react.item.star.3":"You wear a star on your chest. You don't poke things with it.","react.item.star.4":"A badge doesn't solve anything by itself.","react.item.sticker.1":'Slap a "77.7" on it? Lousy disguise.',"react.item.sticker.2":"Lenny would be flattered. Still won't help me.","react.item.sticker.3":"A sticker fixes nothing. Not even my mood.","react.item.sticker.4":"Lenny's autograph isn't a magic spell. Though it looks like one.","react.item.tape.1":"A tape needs a tape deck. That is not a tape deck.","react.item.tape.2":"Holding a tape up to your ear doesn't work either. Tested.","react.item.tape.3":"You don't poke your main piece of evidence at random things.","react.item.tape.4":"Tape doesn't like damp. Or weird experiments.","react.item.techkeys.1":"These keys open the dish hatches. Only the dish hatches.","react.item.techkeys.2":"Try every key on the ring? Sure. I already know how it ends.","react.item.techkeys.3":"The keys jingle. That's the only result so far.","react.item.techkeys.4":"Small keys. Small idea.","react.item.ticket.1":"It's a laundry ticket. This isn't a laundromat.","react.item.ticket.2":"Number one-seventeen. And? Nothing.","react.item.ticket.3":"One order of common sense on this ticket, please. No? Figured.","react.item.ticket.4":'A pink slip of paper. Nowhere does it say "use here."',"react.item.walkie.1":"Sammy, come in. This idea's a bust. Over.","react.item.walkie.2":"Bang the walkie on it? Sammy would never forgive me.","react.item.walkie.3":"Channel seven is silent. Even it's speechless.","react.item.walkie.4":"I can radio for help. Nobody's going to suggest this.","react.npc.agatha.1":"That's not a ticket. No ticket, no talk.","react.npc.agatha.2":"I won't wash it. I won't store it. I won't even look at it.","react.npc.agatha.3":"Leave it on the counter, I'll log it as lost and found. Kidding. Put it away.","react.npc.agatha.4":"Thirty years behind this counter. Nobody ever dropped that off.","react.npc.buck.1":"No. Next.","react.npc.buck.2":"We saw stuff like that here. Want it sawed?","react.npc.buck.3":"No time. And I don't need that.","react.npc.buck.4":"Might as well bring me a log. At least I'd take a log.","react.npc.doris.1":"Hon, I wouldn't take that as a tip.","react.npc.doris.2":"That's not pie and it's not coffee. So it's not my department.","react.npc.doris.3":"Put that away before I start wiping it down. I wipe down everything.","react.npc.doris.4":"Eight years behind this counter, I've been handed all kinds of things. That's top three.","react.npc.ellen.1":"Received. Not confirmed. Out.","react.npc.ellen.2":"That's not regulation. And it's not relevant.","react.npc.ellen.3":"Thanks. But this is a console, not a coat check.","react.npc.ellen.4":"Say again. No, don't, I got it. Negative.","react.npc.grey.1":"Wrong thing, wrong person. But I like where your head is at.","react.npc.grey.2":"Keep it. The mountain doesn't take gifts. Neither do we.","react.npc.grey.3":"For forty years people have held things out to me. None of them was the answer.","react.npc.grey.4":"Curious. No. But curious.","react.npc.gus.1":"Not buying. Not trading. Especially after midnight.","react.npc.gus.2":"I don't sell that. And I'm not starting now.","react.npc.gus.3":"Wouldn't take it for three bucks. Wouldn't take it for free.","react.npc.gus.4":"Feds. Always shoving the wrong thing at you.","react.npc.hal.1":"That ain't smokes and it ain't gas. So it ain't my business.","react.npc.hal.2":"Ha. What's that, from the future? Kidding. Put it away.","react.npc.hal.3":"Set it on the hood. No, don't. Take it back.","react.npc.hal.4":"Tell you what: I finish this smoke, you put that away.","react.npc.hanley.1":"Well... You keep that. My evidence locker's full of junk as it is.","react.npc.hanley.2":"That for me? Well... no. Thanks, but no.","react.npc.hanley.3":"Thirty years a sheriff, nobody ever offered me that. Put it away before somebody sees.","react.npc.hanley.4":"Well... let me think. Okay, I thought. No.","react.npc.harold.1":"No wires, no tubes? Then I'm not interested.","react.npc.harold.2":"Agatha would call that junk. And she'd be right. She's always right.","react.npc.harold.3":"If it doesn't have a frequency, I've got no use for it.","react.npc.harold.4":"Forty years I've dragged home junk for antennas. Even I won't take that.","react.npc.joe.1":"That's no use on a shift. Put it away before the crew laughs us off the lot.","react.npc.joe.2":"All my years on the job, never seen that. Don't care to.","react.npc.joe.3":"I gotta get home to my boy. My wife won't let me in the door with that.","react.npc.joe.4":"Won't saw, won't split, won't burn. So it's no good.","react.npc.koch.1":"Outside objects are not allowed on the ward. Put it away.","react.npc.koch.2":"Not on the schedule. Rounds in three minutes. Put it away.","react.npc.koch.3":"There's no line for that on the patient inventory. So it doesn't exist.","react.npc.koch.4":"My job is taking things like that away from people. Not accepting them.","react.npc.lenny.1":"Is that a bug? No? That's what they all say. Keep it away from the mike.","react.npc.lenny.2":"Interesting. Very interesting. I don't want it, but I'm writing it down. For the theory.","react.npc.lenny.3":"This is radio, agent. Nobody can see that on the air.","react.npc.lenny.4":"Folks, I'm being handed something on air. I decline. For the record: I declined.","react.npc.miller.1":"Quiet... That doesn't make a sound. I need something that sounds.","react.npc.miller.2":"You hear that? No? Neither do I.","react.npc.miller.3":"No. Wrong frequency.","react.npc.miller.4":"Put it down. Later. She's about to speak.","react.npc.ollendorf.1":"It isn't time to give that away. And not to me.","react.npc.ollendorf.2":"Keep it. Things remember who carried them.","react.npc.ollendorf.3":"The rain won't take it. Neither will I.","react.npc.ollendorf.4":"You're handing me yesterday. I'm waiting for tomorrow.","react.npc.otto.1":"Zero. Zero. Zero.","react.npc.otto.2":"Out of tune. B-flat where it should be C.","react.npc.otto.3":"Rest. A long rest. A whole note of silence.","react.npc.otto.4":"One... no. Wrong number.","react.npc.patterson.1":"The old books say everything has its place. That one's place isn't here.","react.npc.patterson.2":"Hush. And put it away. Mostly hush.","react.npc.patterson.3":"That is not a book. This, in case you missed it, is a library.","react.npc.patterson.4":"My cat is eyeing that with suspicion. I trust her judgment.","react.npc.ross.1":"On paper, that's not evidence. On sight, either.","react.npc.ross.2":"For me? I'm touched. No.","react.npc.ross.3":"That's not going in the report. You get to explain it.","react.npc.ross.4":"Quantico would be proud. No, really. Put it away.","react.npc.sammy.1":"That for a trade? Nah, no deal. Over and out.","react.npc.sammy.2":"Copy. Object unidentified. Repeat: unidentified.","react.npc.sammy.3":"Is it top secret? If it's not top secret, I don't want it.","react.npc.sammy.4":"Agent, in the movies they do something with that. Not this, though. Over.","react.npc.vail.1":"Now, now. You keep that. I have patients enough.","react.npc.vail.2":"Forgive me, I didn't catch that. And I'd rather not.","react.npc.vail.3":"Handing people things like that is an interesting symptom. I'll make a note.","react.npc.vail.4":"Put that on the nightstand. Better yet, in your pocket. Your own.","react.npc.walter.1":"The chart recorder doesn't react to that. Neither do I.","react.npc.walter.2":"Interesting specimen. Not a geological one, though. Thanks, no.","react.npc.walter.3":`I'll log it: "Something offered. Declined."`,"react.npc.walter.4":"There's no room in the tent as it is. Not even for that."};export{e as default};
